Now this Agreement witnesses as follows:
The Grantor hereby grants and conveys to the Grantee a permanent and irrevocable Right of Way over the pathway shown in the sketch annexed herewith.

The pathway shall be used only for ingress and egress by foot or by vehicle to access the Grantee’s property.

The Grantee shall not cause any obstruction or encroachment on the pathway and shall maintain it in good condition at his/her own expense.

The Grantor agrees that he/she and their heirs, successors or assigns shall not, at any time, revoke or interfere with the said Right of Way granted to the Grantee.

This agreement shall be binding upon both parties, their heirs, successors, and assigns.

